  "crew": [
    {
      "name": "Adam Buyskes",
      "avatar": "/media/media::image::c::9511881484::vessel::d5cbfbdd-fe8c-11ed-889f-43d4bb723744::assets::3f8a7ba0-b05e-11f0-b9f9-75e55cef995b/{imageVariant}",
      "role": "Captain",
      "bio": "Captain Adam hails from Knysna, South Africa, where\nhe began his seafaring skills, growing up sailing dinghies\nand his father’s majestic 60ft gaff-rigged ketch,\neventually crossing the Atlantic Ocean at the age of 18,\nto the Caribbean.\nThis led him into his career, amounting 25 years of\nexpert skippering experience with both sail and power\nboats (commercial and recreational). He is also a\ncertified salvage and commercial diver and large crane\noperator, he blends his hands-on expertise with a\ncustomer focused approach, prioritizing safety above all\nelse.\nHaving called the British Virgin Islands home for 17\nyears, he possesses an intimate knowledge of the\nregion’s renowned hotspots and hidden treasures.\nCaptain Adam has local connections to organize\noutstanding dive rendezvous for any enthusiastic diver\non board, or any excursion available to guests in the BVI\nor further down the Caribbean if needed.\nHe is also an avid kiteboarder, and is a master of the\nBVI’s premier water sport locations. In his role, he\ndelights in leading thrilling sailing adventures and water\nsport experiences, all aboard the luxurious vessel SY\nBodhisattva, under his command.\nWhen not at sea, Captain Adam treasures every moment\nwith his cherished daughter, Izzy, and wife, Elisabeth, on\ntheir home island of Tortola."
    }
